    "event_id": "EV-c92db935a2cef0d6",
    "subject": "Google announces Gemini 3.7 Flash just three weeks after previous",
    "predicate": "product_release",
    "object": "This may be more about maintaining the appearance of constant improvements in Google’s AI. Throughout 2024 and 2025, Google rapidly made up ground to rival the best AI coming out of competing AI labs. Things appear to have slowed in 2026, though. At I/O in May, Google promised that the flagship Gemini 3.5 Pro would launch in June, but that never happened.",
    "claim_ref": "CL-0788a31e290e7a05",
    "source_refs": [
      "SA-9d1d496d617dd409"
    ]
